r personality is the deck. Your choices, relationships, and circumstances shape the cards you carry, the contradictions you live with, and the story told about who you became.Live a lifetime in the demo. Then begin again and discover how it feels to become someone else.What’s coming in the full game?For the full release, we’re working on three things:Mo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:34:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691115","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4999750-1846018067935146","game_id":"steam-4999750","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo content, A whole life in the demo. More possibilities in the full game.","summary":"In one life, you might find your voice on a stage. In another, power, faith, or simply staying afloat might become the centre of your world.But if you followed the same path with a different personality, would you become the same person?In the What Have I Become? demo, you can explore different lives, reach the end of a life, and then begin again. Your cards, choices, and circumstances carry the traces of who you become.The demo is free on Windows, with English and Turkish available.What can you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T01:50:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935146","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4999750-1846018067926822","game_id":"steam-4999750","kind":"announcement","title":"The What Have I Become? demo is out now","summary":"The What Have I Become? demo is now available for free on Steam. Download it for Windows and play in English or Turkish.Download the free demoA life begins. You don’t know who you’ll become yet. Years later, you may still be working on that.Your personality is the deck.What Have I Become? is a short, replayable narrative life sim where your personality takes the form of cards. The cards in your deck carry the habits, gifts, defenses, and contradictions that become part of you. Your choices can s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T16:51:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926822","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4999750-1843481262697593","game_id":"steam-4999750","kind":"announcement","title":"The What Have I Become? demo is coming soon","summary":"The What Have I Become? demo is coming soon to Steam.Your personality is the deck. The cards you carry reflect the habits, desires, and defenses that take shape through your choices. They can strengthen, weaken, or transform as your life unfolds.In the demo, you’ll make decisions that change this deck—and encounter situations where the person you’ve become changes how you can respond. An option that came easily in one life may be difficult in another. Start again, make different choices, and see","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T14:49:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697593","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4999750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4999750":"2026-10-26T07:12:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4999750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_check